},
["text"] = "Bunten’s PUG-Proof M+ Routes",
["objects"] = {
{
["d"] = {
"448.7",
"-371.9",
1,
true,
"Walk up / left along the wall behind the buildings here - dodge the Peacekeeper",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"428",
"-297.4",
1,
true,
"Unknown",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"374.5",
"-274.9",
1,
true,
"1️⃣ Tanks keep the boss still so your team can kick footbombs accurately.\n2️⃣ DPS soak coins before the boss eats them and dodge Shocking Claw.\n3️⃣ Healers watch out for Static Pulse—players will take shock damage over time.\n4️⃣ On Mythic, everyone helps kick footbombs back at the boss to stop Timed Detonation.\n\n\n🛡 Tanks:\n\nKeep the boss still so your team can kick the footbombs back at it.\nDon’t let the boss eat coins—it gets stronger with every coin pile it absorbs!\n⚔️ DPS:\n\nDodge Shocking Claw—it zaps and stuns anyone in front.\nOn Mythic difficulty, kick the Azerite Footbombs back at the boss to stop Timed Detonation from hurting the team.\n❤️ Healers:\n\nStatic Pulse shocks players over time—heal through it.\nAvoid big damage from Timed Detonation by helping kick footbombs back at the boss.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"356.8",
"-252",
1,
true,
"Extractors are sneaky painful.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"256.6",
"-149.4",
1,
true,
"1️⃣ Use Fracking Totem to control Earthragers—don’t attack them while they are frozen!\n2️⃣ Kill Earthragers fast before Azerite Infusion makes them too strong.\n3️⃣ Run if an Earthrager chases you with Raging Gaze.\n4️⃣ Tanks keep Azerokk away from the group to avoid Tectonic Smash.\n5️⃣ Healers be ready for AoE damage from Resonant Quake and Azerite Aftershock (Mythic).\n\n🛡 Tanks:\n\nKeep Azerokk away from the group to avoid Tectonic Smash (big frontal attack). You can side step this ability once the cast starts\nBe ready for multiple Earthragers—they hit hard and must be controlled.\n⚔️ DPS:\n\nKill Earthragers quickly before Azerite Infusion makes them stronger!\nIf you see a Fracking Totem, do NOT hit the Earthrager trapped inside.\nIf an Earthrager targets you with Raging Gaze, run away!\n❤️ Healers:\n\nResonant Quake hits everyone and slows movement—be ready for AoE healing.\nJagged Cut stacks up on players—watch for people taking heavy bleed damage.\nAzerite Aftershock (Mythic) deals even more damage—expect big healing moments.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"471",
"-98",
1,
true,
"1️⃣ Tanks move Rixxa away from Azerite Catalyst patches.\n2️⃣ Everyone avoid standing in Azerite Catalyst—it hurts a lot!\n3️⃣ Don’t get knocked back into Azerite when Propellant Blast happens.\n4️⃣ Healers be ready to dispel/heal anyone those with Chemical Burn. THREE (3) total\n\n🛡 Tanks:\n\nKeep Rixxa away from Azerite Catalyst patches so the team has space to move.\nBe ready to reposition if the room gets crowded with Azerite.\n⚔️ DPS:\n\nWatch where Azerite Catalyst is placed—stay out of it!\nDon’t get pushed into Azerite Catalyst when she uses Propellant Blast.\n❤️ Healers:\n\nKeep an eye on players who step in Azerite Catalyst—it hurts a lot.\nAvoid getting pushed into the Azerite by Propellant Blast.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"439.9",
"-425.3",
1,
true,
"Walk along the wall and dodge the patrol.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"413.4",
"-361.1",
1,
true,
"Walk towards the middle of the room and dodge the patrol.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"596.8",
"-215.7",
1,
true,
"P1\n1️⃣ Dodge the Gatling Gun—never stand in front of him!\n2️⃣ Run from Homing Missile so it doesn’t hit the group. (Prios ranged players if in group)\n3️⃣ Stay out of red circles from Micro Missiles (Heroic+).\nP2\n\n1️⃣ Move when the drill lands—it hurts a lot!\n2️⃣ Dodge falling rockets—they keep burning the ground after impact.\n3️⃣ Avoid standing in the line of Azerite Heartseeker—it reduces healing!\n4️⃣ Spread out so grenades and jumps don’t hit multiple people.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"422.3",
"-476.7",
1,
true,
"have suggestions? come say hi https://www.twitch.tv/thebunten",
},
["n"] = true,
},
{
["d"] = {
"469.9",
"-366.7",
1,
true,
"If you accidentally pull extra enemies at the start, you can still skip this Peacekeeper. Position yourself between the building and the fence, then jump onto the box at the corner of the fence and hop over. No special skips or tricks are required.",
},
["n"] = true,
},
